From 9e2ce9f4f58e60ac4c7e2ceaebeb2625d7ccf83c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:00:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add metrics.serviceMonitor.enabled to allow skipping the
 ServiceMonitor

Add an optional `enabled` field to the ServiceMonitor spec, shared by the
MariaDB and MaxScale metrics configuration. It defaults to true, so existing
resources keep their behaviour. When set to false, the operator still deploys
the exporter Deployment and Service but neither requires the ServiceMonitor
CRD nor creates the ServiceMonitor object. This allows scraping the exporter
from a Prometheus running outside of the cluster.

Closes #1828
